    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1 class="hero-title">Online Maths Tuition — Small Batches, Real Attention, Real Results</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">Not a recorded lecture. Not a batch of 50 students staring at a screen. This is live, interactive, small-batch maths tuition — 3 to 5 students per class, with real-time correction on every problem your child solves. Available to students anywhere in India.</p>
                <p class="hero-supporting">3–5 Students/batch · 60 min/session · 13+ Years Teaching · ₹8,000/month onwards</p>
                <div class="hero-cta">
                    <a href="https://wa.me/917396669430?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20book%20a%20diagnostic%20test%20for%20online%20maths%20tuition." class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Book Diagnostic Test (₹750)</a>
                    <a href="tel:+917396669430" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large">Call: 73966 69430</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 1: What Makes Our Online Tuition Different -->
    <section class="why-choose-us">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">This Isn't an Online Lecture. Your Child Actually Solves, Shares, and Gets Corrected — Every Session.</h2>
            <div class="why-grid">
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>3–5 Students Per Batch</h3>
                    <p>Not 15, not 30, not 50. Your child is not a viewer — they're actively solving problems with personal attention every class.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Real-Time WhatsApp Corrections</h3>
                    <p>Student solves a problem → photographs their work → shares on WhatsApp → teacher checks immediately → corrects mistakes on the spot. Faster than any homework-based model.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Diagnostic-First Approach</h3>
                    <p>We start with a 60-minute assessment to find gaps — even from 2–3 years ago. We don't teach what your child already knows. We fix what's broken first.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>All Major Boards</h3>
                    <p><a href="/cbse-tuition-jubilee-hills">CBSE</a>, <a href="/icse-tuition-hyderabad">ICSE</a>, <a href="/igcse-tuition-jubilee-hills">IGCSE</a>, IB MYP/DP, AS & A Levels, State Board. Teaching style, practice sets, and marking approach matched to your child's specific board.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Foundation Before Syllabus</h3>
                    <p>If your child needs Class 7 concepts to understand Class 10 maths, we go there. No shame. No rushing. That's not going backward — that's building properly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>No Special Equipment Needed</h3>
                    <p>A phone or laptop, a notebook, a pen, and WhatsApp. That's it. No tablets, no special apps, no expensive setup.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: How Online Classes Work -->
    <section class="section bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">How a Typical Online Session Works</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Every online session is 60 minutes, live, with 3–5 students. Here's the flow:</p>
            <div class="content-grid">
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>1. Quick Recall (5–10 min)</h3>
                    <p>Session starts with retrieval practice on previous topics. Keeps old concepts active.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>2. Concept + Guided Solving (30–40 min)</h3>
                    <p>Teacher explains step-by-step, students solve in their notebook with live guidance. This is active practice, not passive watching.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>3. Photo → WhatsApp → Instant Correction</h3>
                    <p>Students photograph their written working and share it. Teacher checks each solution in real time. Mistakes are caught and corrected immediately — not the next day.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>4. Exit Check + Homework</h3>
                    <p>Quick independent problem to confirm understanding. Homework given — students send photos of their attempts before the next session.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="section-intro" style="margin-top: 2rem;">This system gives faster feedback than traditional offline tuition. In a regular class, homework gets checked next session — by which time the student has already practised the wrong method 10 times. In our system, every error is caught live.</p>
            <div class="hero-cta" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
                <a href="/how-we-teach" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large">Read more about our teaching methodology</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Grades We Teach Online -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Online Maths Tuition for Grades 6–12</h2>
            <div class="offer-grid">
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Grades 6–8: Building Strong Foundations</h3>
                    <p>This is where most gaps start — and where fixing them has the biggest impact. We cover number systems, integers, fractions, basic algebra, geometry, and develop proper problem-solving habits. If your child is struggling in Class 9 or 10, the real issue often started here.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Grades 9–10: Board Exam Preparation</h3>
                    <p>Algebra, geometry, trigonometry, coordinate geometry, statistics — taught in sequence so each concept builds on the last. For students with gaps, we fix foundations first before moving to grade-level content. CBSE, ICSE, IGCSE, State Board.</p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 1rem;"><a href="/online-class-10-tuition"><strong>See Online Class 10 Plans →</strong></a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Grades 11–12: Advanced Mathematics</h3>
                    <p>Calculus, trigonometry, probability, vectors, 3D geometry — with strong emphasis on fundamentals. Maths, Physics, Chemistry available. CBSE, ISC, IB DP, A Levels.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 4: Pricing -->
    <section class="section bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Online Maths Tuition — Plans & Pricing</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Transparent pricing. No hidden fees. No lock-in contracts. Pay monthly.</p>
            <div class="offer-grid">
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Regular — ₹5,500/month</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>3 sessions per week</li>
                        <li>60 minutes per session</li>
                        <li>3–5 students per batch</li>
                        <li>Real-time WhatsApp corrections</li>
                        <li>Weekly revision & error tracking</li>
                        <li>Parent progress updates</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card" style="border-left-color: var(--primary-color);">
                    <h3>Intensive — ₹9,500/month</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>5 sessions per week</li>
                        <li>60 minutes per session</li>
                        <li>3–5 students per batch</li>
                        <li>Real-time WhatsApp corrections</li>
                        <li>Daily practice + revision cycles</li>
                        <li>Board exam strategy & mock tests</li>
                        <li>Priority doubt clearing</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="section-intro" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">All plans start after a <a href="/diagnostic-assessment">₹750 diagnostic test</a> (one-time). Science add-on available at additional cost. Pricing shown is for online classes — contact us for in-person rates at our Jubilee Hills centre.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 5: ANKURAM vs Large Online Platforms -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Why Small-Batch Beats Mass Online Tuition</h2>
            <div class="offer-grid">
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>ANKURAM</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Batch size: 3–5 students</li>
                        <li>Student solves in every session</li>
                        <li>Real-time WhatsApp photo corrections</li>
                        <li>Diagnostic before enrollment</li>
                        <li>Teacher knows each student by name, by mistake pattern</li>
                        <li>Personalized plan based on diagnostic</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Vedantu / Byju's / Others</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Batch size: 15–50+ students</li>
                        <li>Mostly watching, not solving</li>
                        <li>Homework checked later</li>
                        <li>Usually no diagnostic</li>
                        <li>Anonymous in large batch</li>
                        <li>Same syllabus for everyone</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 6: Students From Across India -->
    <section class="section bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Learn From Anywhere in India</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Our online maths tuition is available to students anywhere. We currently teach students from Hyderabad, Bangalore, Mumbai, Delhi, and other cities — as well as students in the UK, USA, and Middle East. All you need is a stable internet connection.</p>
            <p class="section-intro">For students in Hyderabad, we also offer a hybrid model — online classes during the week, in-person sessions at our Jubilee Hills centre on weekends.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 7: FAQs -->
    <section class="faq-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Is online maths tuition effective for children?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Yes — because our batches are small (3–5 students) and our WhatsApp photo system gives real-time feedback. Every student actively solves problems in every session. This is not a lecture your child passively watches.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">What technology does my child need?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">A phone or laptop with stable internet, a notebook and pen, and WhatsApp on a phone for sharing work photos. No special apps or expensive equipment.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">What grades do you teach online?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Grades 6–12. Maths is our primary subject. Science (Physics, Chemistry, Biology) available for Grades 6–10. Physics, Chemistry, Maths for Grades 11–12.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Which boards do you support?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">CBSE, ICSE, IGCSE, IB MYP/DP, AS & A Levels, and State Board. Teaching approach and practice sets are matched to your child's specific board.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">What are the fees for online maths tuition?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Regular plan (3 sessions/week) is ₹5,500/month. Intensive plan (5 sessions/week) is ₹9,500/month. A one-time diagnostic test (₹750) is required before enrollment.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Can my child try a session before committing?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Instead of a trial class, we offer a diagnostic assessment (₹750) — which is more useful. It tells us where your child stands, what gaps exist, and what plan they need. The diagnostic itself is valuable whether or not you continue.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">What times are online classes held?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Most online batches run between 4 PM and 9 PM IST. Exact timing is decided after the diagnostic based on student's school schedule and batch availability.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">How is ANKURAM different from hiring a private online tutor?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">A private tutor teaches. We diagnose first, then teach. Our structured approach — diagnostic → foundation repair → concept building → exam readiness — means your child isn't just doing random chapters. There's a plan, and every session builds on the last.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

